    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar T1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar le voyageur\n\u0022Bien le bonjour, seigneur ! Je suis bien heureux de voir que vous avez r\u00E9ussi \u00E0 parvenir sans encombres jusqu\u0027\u00E0 nous. L\u0027Inquisiteur Philippe d\u0027Agincourt vous attend dans la ville de Fhindar, plus au nord. Je vais vous y mener...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0023",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lancier",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar T2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar le voyageur \n \u0022Attention ! Ces fleuves sont hant\u00E9s par des sorci\u00E8res des mers qui aiment s\u0027attaquer aux voyageurs. Ne restez pas dans l\u0027eau !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0024",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar Mort",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0025",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0026",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar Milieu 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lancier\n\u0022D\u00E9sol\u00E9 Nobar... A part vous, personne ne peut passer. Ce sont les ordres de Philippe !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0027",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar Milieu 2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lancier\n\u0022Bonjour, Nobar. A part vous, personne n\u0027a le droit de passer par ici. Ce sont les ordres de Philippe d\u0027Agincourt lui-m\u00EAme...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Araign\u00E9e en chasse T10",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0028",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0029",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Arm\u00E9e d\u0027Hubert T30",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hubert de Lalye\n\u0022Avez-vous appr\u00E9ci\u00E9 mes petites amies soyeuses ? Ah, vous auriez d\u00FB vous rallier \u00E0 moi, comme les autres... Vous avez sign\u00E9 votre arr\u00EAt de mort et Fhindar sera mienne ! Ah ah ah... \u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ranger \n\u0022Seigneur, nous devons arr\u00EAter Hubert de Lalye avant qu\u0027il ne s\u0027empare de la ville de Fhindar !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 5
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "OBJECT_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Tuer Hubert de Lalye avant qu\u0027il ne capture la ville de Fhindar. Uther ne doit pas mourir.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Araign\u00E9e en chasse T20",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ranger\n\u0022Les araign\u00E9es fuient leurs antres ! Nos \u00E9claireurs ont vu de la fum\u00E9e s\u0027\u00E9lever au-dessus de la For\u00EAt de Soie... Qui peut avoir fait une chose pareille ?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 5
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Uther arrive T33",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Uther\n\u0022Je nettoierai l\u0027empire de tous ceux de votre engeance, Hubert de Lalye ! Pr\u00E9parez-vous \u00E0 mourir... L\u0027Empire reviendra bient\u00F4t \u00E0 son propri\u00E9taire l\u00E9gitime !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hubert de Lalye \n\u0022Un enfant ? Ah ah ah, serait-ce la seule arme de l\u0027Empire ? D\u00E9mosth\u00E8ne n\u0027est qu\u0027un l\u00E2che...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN002c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lancier",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Avertissement For\u00EAt de Soie",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar le voyageur\n\u0022Cette for\u00EAt que nous apercevons est la For\u00EAt de la Soie. Peu nombreux sont ceux qui osent s\u0027y aventurer, \u00E0 cause des terribles cr\u00E9atures qui y prolif\u00E8rent...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN002d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN002e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Entrer dans Fhindar",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar le voyageur\n\u0022Fhindar est proche ! Dirigez-vous vers l\u0027ouest. Plus d\u0027un chemin vous y m\u00E8nera...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN002f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lancier",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar T5",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar le voyageur\n\u0022Philippe d\u0027Agincourt est un homme prudent... Il a bloqu\u00E9 tous les passages menant \u00E0 Fhindar. J\u0027esp\u00E8re qu\u0027il vous laissera passer !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0030",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0031",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mort Lancier bas",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0032",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mort Lancier haut",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vicctoire qu\u00EAte (mort d\u0027Hubert)",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hubert de Lalye\n\u0022Vous... Vous m\u0027avez vaincu ! Comment est-ce possible ? Soyez maudit, Uther !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Uther \n\u0022Votre sort sera celui de tous les ennemis de l\u0027Empire. J\u0027apporterai mon aide \u00E0 mon p\u00E8re et, ensemble, nous ram\u00E8nerons la paix dans le royaume de Nevendaar !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0034",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ours polaire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hubert gagne",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hubert de Lalye\n\u0022Ah ah ah ! Maintenant que la ville de Fhindar est sous mon contr\u00F4le, plus rien ne viendra s\u0027opposer \u00E0 moi... M\u00EAme l\u0027intervention d\u0027Uther n\u0027y pourra rien !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Texte Castel Khazan",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Archer\n\u0022De nombreux p\u00EAcheurs ont disparu en mer... Les paysans pensent qu\u0027ils ont \u00E9t\u00E9 d\u00E9vor\u00E9s par des monstres marins !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0036",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Sir\u00E8ne",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Texte Silveria",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lancier\n\u0022Fhindar est un peu plus au nord. J\u0027esp\u00E8re sinc\u00E8rement que l\u0027Empereur remportera la guerre... Hubert a ordonn\u00E9 \u00E0 la milice de prendre le contr\u00F4le de toutes les villes des environs !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mouvement de Lofemyr T8",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0037",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0038",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar T30",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar le voyageur\n\u0022Philippe d\u0027Agincourt vous a pris au pi\u00E8ge ! Tout cela n\u0027\u00E9tait qu\u0027une ruse. Soyez prudent, seigneur...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN003a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Kraken",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Uther meurt",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Eccl\u00E9siaste\n\u0022Qu\u0027avons-nous fait ? Uther, le dernier descendant de l\u0027empereur est mort ! L\u0027Empire est irr\u00E9m\u00E9diablement condamn\u00E9 d\u00E9sormais...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "R\u00E9gion de Fhindar",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Uther\n\u0022Je viens au nom de mon p\u00E8re ! Je suis Uther, h\u00E9ritier l\u00E9gitime du tr\u00F4ne. Joignez-vous \u00E0 moi contre les ennemis de l\u0027Empire ! Quant \u00E0 vous, de Lalye, tous vos semblables p\u00E9riront sous mon glaive vengeur ! Pr\u00E9parez-vous \u00E0 mourir...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "OBJECT_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Tuer Hubert de Lalye. Uther ne doit pas mourir.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN003c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Sir\u00E8ne",
